{"id": "bada_renjue", "type": "Text", "title": "佛说八大人觉经", "title_zh": "佛说八大人觉经", "translator": "安世高", "category": "經集部类", "volume": "", "juan_count": 1, "actual_char_count": 471, "canon_ref": "T.474", "taisho": "T0474", "vehicle": "大乘", "mode": "显教", "translation_place": "", "time_from": 148, "belongs_to_school": ["经集部", "诸经杂集"], "parallel_translations": [], "kepan": {"序分": [], "正宗分": ["c000"], "流通分": []}, "chapters": [{"id": "c000", "chapter_no": 1, "chapter_title": "正文", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00000", "p00001", "p00002", "p00003", "p00004", "p00005", "p00006", "p00007", "p00008", "p00009"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c005", "c008", "c010", "c011"], "char_count": 453}], "paragraphs": [{"id": "p00000", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "为佛弟子，常于昼夜至心诵念八大人觉：", "char_count": 18, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00001", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 2, "text_preview": "第一觉悟：世间无常，国土危脆；四大苦空，五阴无我；生灭变异，虚伪无主；心是恶源，形为罪薮。如是观察，渐离生死。", "char_count": 55, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c005", "c011"]}, {"id": "p00002", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 3, "text_preview": "第二觉知：多欲为苦。生死疲劳，从贪欲起；少欲无为，身心自在。", "char_count": 30, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c008"]}, {"id": "p00003", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 4, "text_preview": "第三觉知：心无厌足，惟得多求，增长罪恶；菩萨不尔，常念知足，安贫守道，惟慧是业。", "char_count": 40, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00004", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 5, "text_preview": "第四觉知：懈怠坠落，常行精进，破烦恼恶，摧伏四魔，出阴界狱。", "char_count": 30, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00005", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 6, "text_preview": "第五觉悟：愚痴生死。菩萨常念，广学多闻，增长智慧，成就辩才，教化一切，悉以大乐。", "char_count": 40, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00006", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 7, "text_preview": "第六觉知：贫苦多怨，横结恶缘。菩萨布施，等念怨亲，不念旧恶，不憎恶人。", "char_count": 35, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00007", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 8, "text_preview": "第七觉悟：五欲过患。虽为俗人，不染世乐；常念三衣瓦钵法器，志愿出家，守道清白，梵行高远，慈悲一切。", "char_count": 49, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00008", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 9, "text_preview": "第八觉知：生死炽然，苦恼无量。发大乘心，普济一切；愿代众生受无量苦，令诸众生毕竟大乐。", "char_count": 43, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00009", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 10, "text_preview": "如此八事，乃是诸佛菩萨大人之所觉悟。精进行道，慈悲修慧，乘法身船至涅槃岸；复还生死，度脱众生。以前八事开导一切，令诸众生觉生死苦，舍离五欲，修心圣道。若佛弟子诵", "char_count": 113, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": [], "doctrines": ["c008", "c010"]}], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figure_mentions": [], "doctrine_mentions": [{"concept_id": "c005", "name": "空性", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c011", "name": "五蕴", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c008", "name": "涅槃", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c010", "name": "法身", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "translator_note": "译事未入大事年表", "transmission_events": ["event:translation:安世高"]}